        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka ogwo omukuru w'eihe ayabaire atumirwe Sarigoni omukama wa Asiria yagobire Ashidodi akagitera akagikwata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aho Omukama agambira omu kanwa k'Omurangi Isaya eya Amozi nagamba ati, “Ogende oyekomorore orugunia, ojure n'ebiratwa omu maguru.” Isaya agirakwo, agenda ali bushai atajwete na biratwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama agamba ati, “Okwo Isaya omwiru wange yamara emyaka eshatu nagenda ali bushai, atajwete na biratwa, kubaasira Misiri na Etiopia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nikwo n'omukama wa Asiria alitwara Abamisiri endore, n'Abaetiopia abatware omu buzahe, n'omuto n'omukuru tuligenda bushai, bataina na biratwa, enyio zili aheru, mara ekyo Misiri kiligibera kihemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma abo abatura bagira eshubi omuli Etiopia, nibesigasiga Misiri, tulihahanwa emitima, bashoberwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo abantu b'aha mwaro tuligira bati, ‘Mbwenu abo twayesigaga, tukabairukiraho kutukiza aha mukama wa Asiria, kabaraba babaire batyo, ichwe aho turakira tutai?’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
